WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.290
Unit eight. Drinking Clean Water!

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.016
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:11.605
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.655 --> 00:00:15.631
Today we learn about Drinking Clean Water. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.313 --> 00:00:19.746
Water. Say it with me. Water!

6
00:00:23.266 --> 00:00:26.732
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

7
00:00:30.225 --> 00:00:33.575
Cup. Say it with me. Cup!

8
00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:40.333
Bottle. Say it with me. Bottle!

9
00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:47.230
Thirsty. Say it with me. Thirsty!

10
00:00:50.731 --> 00:00:54.231
Boil. Say it with me. Boil!

11
00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.846
Drink. Say it with me. Drink!

12
00:01:04.353 --> 00:01:08.087
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:11.582 --> 00:01:19.408
When I am thirsty, I drink clean water from my cup or bottle. Boiled or filtered water is safe to drink. Water keeps my body healthy.

14
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:20.645
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.975 --> 00:01:27.259
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.309 --> 00:01:28.459
Cup!

17
00:01:29.138 --> 00:01:34.391
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.441 --> 00:01:35.567
Drink!

19
00:01:36.237 --> 00:01:40.945
Did you know? More than half of your body is made of water!

20
00:01:40.995 --> 00:01:42.934
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:43.624 --> 00:01:51.075
Think and answer. Where do you get clean water to drink?

22
00:01:51.125 --> 00:01:52.275
Great answer!

23
00:01:53.293 --> 00:01:58.096
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:58.146 --> 00:02:00.752
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

